...

## What this rule does

Reports when a `function_definition` appears inside a `classdef` without being
wrapped in a `methods` block. In MATLAB, class methods must be declared inside a
`methods` block. This check fires when the parser cannot create a proper
`class_definition` node because the structure is invalid.

## Examples

